          caption: "A watch, a full minute and a calm child. Fast breathing by the age cut-off is pneumonia; chest indrawing, stridor at rest, cyanosis, saturations below 90 per cent or any danger sign is the child who needs oxygen, a first-dose antibiotic and transport.",
